comments.body:
> @gregtatcam @yinyiqian1 Please review this PR and advise on the next steps.

@ckeshava I don't think this should be "fixed" by failing the transaction — the current outcome is correct; it's the intent that reads unclearly.
AMMClawback is a compliance recovery that deliberately works without holder cooperation: it already withdraws with IgnoreFreeze/IgnoreAuth and recreates deleted MPTokens. Gating the paired-asset return on the holder's reserve reintroduces the holder veto the design intent
